:name: Rust firmware on the BlackPill F411 model
:description: no_std Rust (thumbv7em-none-eabihf) built with 32_17_embedded_rust's toolchain.
$elf?=$ex_out/target/thumbv7em-none-eabihf/release/rust_baremetal

using sysbus
mach create "rust_blackpill"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $ex_dir/../stm32f4_blackpill/blackpill_f411.repl
showAnalyzer usart1
sysbus LoadELF $elf
